            <div xml:id="d14-a2">

                <pb facs="0092" n="12" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg12"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <p>Anton Schimaneck, of Mirovitz, and Francisca Simek, of Ledenitz, Bohemia, were
                    married in St. Nicholas Church, on the 2d of June, 1876, in the presence of the
                    two <pb facs="0093" n="13" xml:id="pg13"/> witnesses, Joseph Tanzer and Joseph
                    Boder, by the Rev. H. L. Fuchs, according to the Catholic rite. This is shown by
                    the register of marriages on file in this church.</p>
                <closer>[<hi rendition="#small-caps">seal.</hi>] <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >J. P. Hoffmann</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Rector of St. Nicholas
                            Church.</hi></signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Brooklyn, N. Y.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1881-06-18"><hi rendition="#italic">June 18,
                        1881</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
